  "details": "<p>Hasan Malay's suggestion of an area south of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"../550683/\">Larisa</a> in <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"../550406\">Aiolis</a> for the location of Kallipatrai is based on the general findspot of the inscription that attests to the name (see References, below).\u00a0</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "A chorion (probably a small village, farm or estate), attested only in a single inscription, and probably located somewhere south of the site of Larisa in Aiolis.",
